></li><li class="textLinks"><a href="https://registry.babycenter.com/?rm_source=navbar">Registry</a></li><li class="textLinks"><a href="/baby-products">Baby Products</a></li></ul><div id="leaderboardContainer" class="mui-19amdqm"></div></div><div id="mainColumn" class="mui-isysqz"><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-container MuiGrid-direction-xs-row mui-cdo0pe"><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-direction-xs-row MuiGrid-grid-xs-12 MuiGrid-grid-sm-7 MuiGrid-grid-md-8 mui-1ylalxf"><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-container MuiGrid-direction-xs-row mui-9vvkmv"><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-direction-xs-row MuiGrid-grid-xs-12 MuiGrid-grid-md-10 bodyContentGridItem mui-wex0te"><div class="mobileMarginProvider"><div class="mui-1ascjsr"><nav class="bodyLinks mui-1khu1oc" aria-label="breadcrumb" data-tracking-location="breadcrumb" data-component-id="breadcrumbInner" data-test-id="breadcrumbNav" data-testid="breadcrumbNav"><ol><li><a href="/pregnancy">Pregnancy</a> <span aria-hidden="true" class="separator">/</span></li><li><a href="/pregnancy/your-life">Your Life</a> </li></ol></nav></div></div></div></div></div><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-direction-xs-row MuiGrid-grid-xs-12 MuiGrid-grid-sm-5 MuiGrid-grid-md-4 mui-9dz8fg"></div><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-direction-xs-row MuiGrid-grid-xs-12 MuiGrid-grid-sm-7 MuiGrid-grid-md-8 mui-1ylalxf"><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-container MuiGrid-direction-xs-row mui-9vvkmv"><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-direction-xs-row MuiGrid-grid-xs-12 MuiGrid-grid-md-10 bodyContentGridItem mui-wex0te" data-tracking-location="artifact body"><article class="mui-q19tgy"><div class="mobileMarginProvider"><div id="primaryCt"><h1>What to do if you&#x27;re in a car accident (even a minor one) while pregnant</h1><div class="basicLinks mui-1bd6kps" data-tracking-location="byline"><div class="bylineAndAvatar"><div class="bylineAvatar"><div class="mui-vi71ew" size="34"><img src="https://assets.babycenter.com/ims/2026/07/ic_factcheck.svg" alt="" role="presentation" width="16" height="16" class="checkmark"/><img alt="Rebecca Amaru, M.D." fetchPriority="high" loading="lazy" width="34" height="34" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mui-ze8dcz" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://assets.babycenter.com/ims/2024/12/rebecca-amaru-bio-pic-dec-2024.jpg?width=80 1x" src="https://assets.babycenter.com/ims/2024/12/rebecca-amaru-bio-pic-dec-2024.jpg?width=80"/></div></div><div><a href="/medical-advisory-board">Medically reviewed</a> by <a data-ga-link-text="reviewer_Rebecca Amaru, M.D." href="/expert-rebecca-amaru">Rebecca Amaru, M.D.</a>, ob-gyn</div></div><div class="bylineAndAvatar"><div class="bylineAvatar"><div class="mui-vi71ew" size="34"><img alt="Alexandra Frost" fetchPriority="high" loading="lazy" width="34" height="34" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mui-ze8dcz" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://assets.babycenter.com/ims/2021/10/Alex-Frost-headshot.jpg?width=80 1x" src="https://assets.babycenter.com/ims/2021/10/Alex-Frost-headshot.jpg?width=80"/></div></div><div>Written by<!-- --> <a data-ga-link-text="author_Alexandra Frost" href="/expert-alexandra-frost">Alexandra Frost</a> | <!-- -->Feb 10, 2026</div></div></div><div class="spacer isReserved mui-12ch3l1" aria-hidden="true"><button class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiButton-root MuiButton-outlined MuiButton-outlinedPrimary MuiButton-sizeMedium MuiButton-outlinedSizeMedium MuiButton-colorPrimary Mui-disabled MuiButton-root MuiButton-outlined MuiButton-outlinedPrimary MuiButton-sizeMedium MuiButton-outlinedSizeMedium MuiButton-colorPrimary preferredSourceBtn mui-14rk1xi" tabindex="-1" type="button" disabled="" data-tracking-location="preferred_source_button" data-ga-link-text="preferred_source"><span class="MuiButton-icon MuiButton-startIcon MuiButton-iconSizeMedium mui-cveorv"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="19.57" height="20" viewBox="0 0 19.5732 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><defs><clipPath id="googleGIconClip"><path d="M19.3987 8.1814H9.9849V12.0445H15.3598C15.1286 13.294 14.4294 14.3596 13.3676 15.0712C12.4746 15.6716 11.3266 16.0211 9.9849 16.0211C7.3864 16.0211 5.1823 14.2666 4.3947 11.9004C4.1952 11.2989 4.0853 10.6599 4.0853 9.9983C4.0853 9.3367 4.1952 8.6966 4.3947 8.0962C5.1823 5.7311 7.3864 3.9755 9.9849 3.9755C11.4524 3.9755 12.767 4.4816 13.8039 5.4713L16.6653 2.6057C14.936 0.9908 12.6786 0 9.9849 0C6.0832 0 2.705 2.2414 1.0618 5.5076C0.383 6.8592 0 8.3834 0 9.9994C0 11.6155 0.383 13.1396 1.0618 14.4913C2.705 17.7597 6.0832 20 9.9849 20C12.6797 20 14.9485 19.1137 16.6018 17.5861C18.4887 15.8452 19.5732 13.2702 19.5732 10.2275C19.5732 9.5182 19.5131 8.835 19.3987 8.1825V8.1814Z"></path></clipPath><filter id="googleGIconBlur" x="-4" y="-4" width="28" height="28" filterUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="1.5"></feGaussianBlur></filter></defs><g clip-path="url(#googleGIconClip)"><g filter="url(#googleGIconBlur)"><rect x="-2" y="-2" width="24" height="9" fill="#FF4641"></rect><rect x="-2" y="4" width="7" height="12" fill="#FFD211"></rect><rect x="-2" y="13" width="24" height="9" fill="#0EBC5F"></rect><rect x="9" y="7" width="13" height="10" fill="#3186FF"></rect></g></g></svg></span>Add us as your preferred source</button></div><div class="heroImg"><img alt="Pregnant woman wearing a seatbelt, focused, driving a car on a daytime road." fetchPriority="high" loading="eager" width="414" height="232" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent;object-fit:cover" sizes="
  (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 3) and (min-width: 1300px) 284px,     
  (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 2) and (min-width: 1300px) 425px,
