<p>Updates to copy, formatting, and sources; medically reviewed for accuracy.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-hydration-on-demand="true"><div class="bodyText mobileMarginProvider hideTopBorder mui-87pcbq"><div class="mui-w99fn7" size="80"><img alt="Alexandra Frost" fetchPriority="low" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mui-ze8dcz" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://assets.babycenter.com/ims/2021/10/Alex-Frost-headshot.jpg?width=80 1x, https://assets.babycenter.com/ims/2021/10/Alex-Frost-headshot.jpg?width=300 2x" src="https://assets.babycenter.com/ims/2021/10/Alex-Frost-headshot.jpg?width=300"/></div><div class="author"><a href="/expert-alexandra-frost">Alexandra Frost</a></div><div>Alexandra Frost is a Cincinnati-based freelance journalist, content marketing writer, copywriter, and editor focusing on health and wellness, parenting, real estate, business, education, and lifestyle. Away from the keyboard, Frost is also mom to four sons under age 7 who keep things chaotic, fun, and interesting.</div></div></div><div data-hydration-on-demand="true"><div class="shareBar mui-ngdanh"><div class="socialIcons"><a title="Twitter" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer" class="bgSocialTwitter" href="http://twitter.com/share?url=https://www.babycenter.com/pregnancy/your-life/what-should-i-do-if-im-in-a-car-accident-while-im-pregnant_7235&amp;text=What to do if you&#x27;re in a car accident (even a minor one) while pregnant" aria-label="Share on Twitter"> <span class="newWindowWarning">Opens a new window</span></a><a title="Pinterest" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" class="bgSocialPinterest" href="http://www.pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=https://www.babycenter.com/pregnancy/your-life/what-should-i-do-if-im-in-a-car-accident-while-im-pregnant_7235&amp;description=What to do if you&#x27;re in a car accident (even a minor one) while pregnant&amp;media=https://assets